                    },
                    "message": "can please add some specifics into what info I can get out of each file and what diagnostics I can infer."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 17,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Deepak Kamat",
                        "email": "deepakkamat6630@gmail.com",
                        "username": "dkamat27"
                    },
                    "message": "Added how we can infer data in the mr - Data we get can be used like\n...\nUART Activity (IRQ28)\n29 interrupts from uart-pl011\nShows serial port activity (console/terminal usage)\nUseful for debugging boot processes or BMC console access\n...\n\nVirtIO Device Activity\n...\nvirtio1-req.0: 1578 interrupts\nvirtio0-input.0: 11 interrupts\nvirtio0-output.0: 58 interrupts\nIndicates storage/network device activity\n...\nHelps identify:\nBlock device operations (disk I/O)\nNetwork packet processing\nPotential virtio-driver issues"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 67,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Rohit PAI ",
                        "email": "rohitpai77@gmail.com",
                        "username": "rohitpai"
                    },
                    "message": "add file size and performance impact"
                },
